WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.690 --> 00:00:05.021
In the years since the Harry Potter film franchise
wrapped up, its cast members have gone on

00:00:05.021 --> 00:00:10.089
to plenty of new projects, finding fresh opportunities
beyond the world of witches and wizards and

00:00:10.089 --> 00:00:12.540
outside the hallowed halls of Hogwarts.

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:16.520
And that includes Evanna Lynch, who brought
Luna Lovegood to life when she joined the

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:20.600
film series in its fifth installment, Harry
Potter and the Order of the Phoenix.

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:23.520
Lynch may have been a latecomer to the massive
Potter franchise,

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:25.540
but she was a very welcome addition.

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:29.460
The Irish actress, who grew up reading the
Harry Potter books, added whimsy and heart

00:00:29.470 --> 00:00:34.219
to the films as Luna, an intelligent and eccentric
Ravenclaw student who believes in some of

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:36.500
the weirdest magical theories around.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:40.660
As a part of Harry's core group, Luna fights
alongside him and his friends at the end of

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:44.160
Order of the Phoenix as they face off against
evil Death Eaters.

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:48.060
She more than proved her worth in the fifth
Harry Potter flick, and from that point on,

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:50.240
Luna is an integral part of the plot.

00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:54.560
And Lynch became an integral part of the franchise
behind the scenes as well, right from the

00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:58.140
moment she went to an open casting call for
the role in 2006.

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:02.240
Lynch was already a huge fan of the books
and the films, and had even sent letters to

00:01:02.249 --> 00:01:03.710
Harry Potter author J.K.

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:05.850
Rowling well before she became a part of the
franchise.

00:01:05.850 --> 00:01:07.110
She told Lorraine Kelly,

00:01:07.110 --> 00:01:09.180
"So, yeah, I wrote to her, and she wrote back.

00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:13.900
And we became friends, and we became, well,
pen friends, before I got the role."

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:17.830
Though she had been in contact with Rowling
prior to auditioning, Lynch won the coveted

00:01:17.830 --> 00:01:23.060
role of Luna fair and square, beating out
a reported 15,000 other young girls who auditioned

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:26.500
to play Luna and impressing during her screen
test with Radcliffe.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:30.860
Lynch was practically born to play the bright-eyed
witch, and the minds behind the film knew

00:01:30.870 --> 00:01:32.940
it; producer David Heyman even said,

00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:36.370
"The others could play Luna; Evanna Lynch
is Luna."

00:01:36.370 --> 00:01:40.140
Rowling has also admitted that as she finished
the final books in the Harry Potter novel

00:01:40.140 --> 00:01:43.240
series, she envisioned Lynch while writing
Luna's scenes.

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:47.420
Lynch clearly tasted the sweetness of success
during her years-long, four-movie turn as

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:51.560
Luna Lovegood, and luckily for the talented
actress, she's continued landing roles after

00:01:51.560 --> 00:01:55.980
the Harry Potter franchise ended in 2011,
both in film and on the stage.

00:01:56.440 --> 00:02:00.700
The actress has booked a number of roles in
live theater, appearing as Luna Lovegood in

00:02:00.710 --> 00:02:07.020
2012's A Very Potter Senior Year, as Bess
Houdini in Peter Snee's 2013 production Houdini,

00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:14.000
as Runt in the 2017-2018 stage adaptation
of the Irish film Disco Pigs, as Gaby in 2019's

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:19.220
The Omission of the Family Coleman, and as
Martha in director Anthony Banks' Games for Lovers.

00:02:19.620 --> 00:02:23.360
On the film side of things, Lynch moved away
from blockbusters after Harry Potter ended

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:27.740
and appeared in several smaller films, including
My Name is Emily, G.B.F., and the British

00:02:27.740 --> 00:02:32.270
television movie Danny and the Human Zoo.
Lynch also played Theresa Bornstein in the

00:02:32.270 --> 00:02:37.380
true-life film Dynamite: A Cautionary Tale,
and had a cameo role in Jason Mewes' Madness

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:38.590
in the Method.

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:41.640
Lynch's after-Potter adventures also took
her to the small screen.

00:02:42.040 --> 00:02:46.500
She's popped up on an episode of the action-adventure
series Sinbad, as well as on the pilot episode

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:47.320
of Apex.

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:52.640
The actress also lent her voice to three different
characters, Academy Voice, Tablet, and Lunchbox,

00:02:52.640 --> 00:02:55.959
on Nickelodeon's animated "Nicktoon" Middle
School Moguls.

00:02:55.959 --> 00:02:59.760
Lynch's highest profile turn since playing
Luna Lovegood came during her time across

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:03.870
the pond on the 27th season of ABC's Dancing
With the Stars.

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:06.720
Along with her dance partner, Keo Motsepe
[KEE-oh moats-EH-pay], she ultimately finished

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:08.460
the competition in third place.

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:12.700
Beyond her professional life, Lynch has also
maintained a personal brand dedicated to health

00:03:12.700 --> 00:03:16.970
and wellness, openly discussing her struggles
with eating disorders and becoming an advocate

00:03:16.970 --> 00:03:18.170
for body positivity.

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:20.730
"I was battling an eating disorder.

00:03:20.730 --> 00:03:24.200
Anyone who's had an eating disorder knows,
it completely takes over your life.

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:27.700
And the only thing that could actually take
my attention apart from that was the Harry

00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:28.720
Potter series."

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:33.180
And she is also a vegan activist, even co-founding
a vegan beauty box with fellow actress and

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:34.940
activist Daniella Monet.

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:38.640
After seeing Lynch come of age on the big
screen, it's gratifying for fans to know that

00:03:38.640 --> 00:03:40.120
she continues to thrive.

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:44.110
The actress clearly has a bright future ahead
of her between her stage work, film career,

00:03:44.110 --> 00:03:45.020
and activism.

00:03:45.020 --> 00:03:48.819
Though the Potter series is over, it's obvious
that Lynch is here to stay.

